# A-Box mirror metadata signing keys (F-05)
# ========================================
# Ed25519 public keys used to verify detached signatures (.sig files) on
# mirror metadata: CORE-VERSIONS, SHA256SUMS, wallos-manifest.txt.
#
# Format per line:  label:base64(raw 32-byte Ed25519 public key)
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines ignored.
#
# THESE MUST MATCH ABOX_SIGNING_PUBKEYS in install.sh (hardcoded trust root).
# This file exists for external audit only — install.sh NEVER reads it at
# runtime (a key fetched from the Release being verified proves nothing).
#
# Rotation: keep primary + next/backup during the dual-key window.
# Revocation: fingerprints (sha256 hex of raw key) go in
# ABOX_REVOKED_PUBKEY_FPS in install.sh; CI re-signs with the backup key.

